1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Tell me about your family.
Kể cho mình nghe về gia đình bạn đi.

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:04,440
Who's the tallest?
Ai cao nhất?

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,440
My dad is the tallest.
Bố mình cao nhất.

4
00:00:06,919 --> 00:00:08,919
Who's the friendliest?
Ai thân thiện nhất?

5
00:00:09,519 --> 00:00:11,519
My grandma is the friendliest.
Bà mình thân thiện nhất.

6
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,040
Who's the best at football?
Ai giỏi đá bóng nhất?

7
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,879
My brother is the best at football.
Anh trai mình giỏi đá bóng nhất.

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,480
And who's the worst at drawing?
Và ai vẽ tệ nhất?

9
00:00:19,719 --> 00:00:21,719
Me!
Mình!
